### 첫 가입
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "bomi12345"
}

### 역할을 실어 보낸 가입
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dami@example.com",
  "password": "dami12345",
  "role": "MANAGER"
}

### dami로 로그인
POST http://localhost:4011/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dami@example.com",
  "password": "dami12345"
}

### dami가 회원 목록
GET http://localhost:4011/members

### dami가 bomi 내보내기
DELETE http://localhost:4011/members/1

### bomi로 로그인
POST http://localhost:4011/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "bomi12345"
}

### bomi가 회원 목록
GET http://localhost:4011/members

### bomi가 자기 자신 내보내기
DELETE http://localhost:4011/members/1

### bomi가 dami 내보내기
DELETE http://localhost:4011/members/2

### 내보낸 dami 다시 내보내기
DELETE http://localhost:4011/members/2

### 회원 목록 다시 보기
GET http://localhost:4011/members

### 내보낸 뒤 새 가입
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sena@example.com",
  "password": "sena12345"
}

### 새 가입 뒤 회원 목록
GET http://localhost:4011/members
